id: pmc-q22j
title: This package generates its own changelog without the flag that stops the heading date coming from the clock
description: "pm-changelog synthesises a pending release window for a version with no matching git tag and stamps it with the current UTC date. Its own changelog scripts and release workflow did not pass the date-from-version flag, the one this package itself ships for exactly that case, so its changelog check regenerates a different heading date every day and fails on any day after the changelog was written. Applied the flag to every invocation of the generator here: two sites in package.json and one in the release workflow."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[3]: changelog,gates,release
created_at: "2026-08-24T09:42:16.204Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-24T09:42:31.009Z"
deadline: "2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"
assignee: "harness:claude-code"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Every invocation of the generator in this package passes the flag, and changelog check passes on a day other than the version's own calendar date"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pmc-ilrh,related,"2026-08-24T09:42:16.204Z","harness:claude-code","cli:create:dep",detected
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-24T09:42:16.204Z","harness:claude-code",Found while rolling this fix across the fleet; this package was exposed to the defect it fixes for everyone else.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-24T09:42:16.204Z","harness:claude-code","Site audit after the change: package.json 2 of 2 flagged, release.yml 1 of 1 flagged."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-24T09:42:16.204Z","harness:claude-code",A package that ships a remedy is not automatically a package that applies it; the rollout has to include the origin repo.
files[2]:
  - path: package.json
    scope: project
  - path: .github/workflows/release.yml
    scope: project
    note: the release workflow's generator invocation now derives the no-tag date from the calendar version
tests[1]{command,scope}:
  "npm run changelog:check",project
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/blob/main/README.md",project,flag reference
body: "The release workflow tags only after npm publish succeeds. Publish has failed fleet wide since 2026-08-21, so this package carries an untagged version and sits on the clock dependent path its own flag exists to remove."
